# LogBeamOS: "LogBeamOS Programs" manager (Gestor de Programas LogBeamOS), 1.0.0. Author's decisions of 22/11/2026:
# - it replaces the Linux Mint Software Manager for every kind of software, with categories like Mint's;
# - the main category, on the home page, is the amateur radio programs one (the LogBeamOS catalogue, lb_programas);
# - Windows programs (Wine) are installed and removed here too.
# Radio programs are installed and removed by the LogBeamOS helper (programas-raiz → actualizar-raiz, one password);
# Wine programs as the user, in the user's own prefix. The rest of the software goes through the Linux Mint engine
# (mintcommon.installer, package mint-common: apt through PackageKit, Flatpak), which stays when the Mint Software
# Manager leaves; its categories are Mint's (the lists come with this package, /usr/share/logbeamos/programas/categorias).
# Usage: logbeamos-programas [--programa KEY | --instalar KEY | --pacote NAME | FILE.flatpakref | FILE.flatpakrepo]
